#: clients/templates/clients/saas_admin/tenants_list.html
msgid ""
"حذف آمن (Soft Delete) لإخفاء الشركات بدون كسر الفواتير التاريخية. الـ Force "
"Delete مقيد بالـ Super Owner."
msgstr ""
"Safe deletion (Soft Delete) hides companies without breaking historical "
"invoices. Force Delete is restricted to the Super Owner."

